abstract: "Twelve months (November 2025 to October 2026) of outbound prospecting for U.S. manufacturers: 1,271 quotes, 268 purchase orders and $127.3M quoted, by state, region, industry, quote size and prospecting channel, plus 439,358 calls and 621,119 emails of activity."
